<title>USA: Hibbett Q4 Feb 1 same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hibbett Q4 Feb 1 same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Per cent change</p>
<p>			   1997    1996  Total Same-store</p>
<p> Fourth qtr(1)   $   26.8    22.0   +26.4  +6.1</p>
<p> Year		    86.4    67.1(2)+30.4  +10.2</p>
<p>Full company name is Hibbett Sport Goods Inc.</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The company's prior fiscal year included 53 weeks so the fiscal periods 1997 and 1996 are not comparable.</p>
<p>(1) Sales for the fourth quarter ended February 1, 1997 covers 13 weeks and same store sale comparison for the period also covers 13 weeks. Sales for the prior-year quarter ended February 3, 1996 covers 14 weeks.</p>
<p>(2) Fiscal year 1996 covers 53 weeks ended February 3, 1996.</p>
</text>
